    "number": "Theorem (thm:self-conc-linear-bandits)",
    "quote": "Let K\\subset R^d be a convex body, \\eta>0, and D be a \\vartheta-self-concordant perturbation for K, such that E[\\nabla\\phi_K(\\theta+\\xi)\\nabla\\phi_K(\\theta+\\xi)^\\top] is non-singular for all \\theta. Then, SC-FTPL with learning rate \\eta and perturbation D has its regret bounded by R_n\\le \\frac{\\vartheta \\ln n}{\\eta}+\\eta \\sum_{t=1}^n \\E[\\|\\hat y_t\\|_t^2]+2, provided that 2\\eta \\|\\hat y_t\\|_t\\le1 almost surely for all t\\in[n]..."
